Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **427 reports**.

**Merged as one issue. Triaged into 2 root causes.** The parser reads dates month first, and our tenants write the day first (parser issue, 393 reports). Form v3 shows MM/DD hints to day-first users (hint issue, 34 reports). Both have been filed as separate GitHub issues in the public triage repository.

<Callout>
Known. Two distinct problems, two fixes queued. See the triage page.
</Callout>

